'''Springtime Kenshin''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Easter Carnival (Gacha Event)|Easter Carnival]] event. This unit is an [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|Anti-Angel]] variant of [[Uesugi Kenshin (Uber Rare Cat)|Uesugi Kenshin]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]] grants [[Immune to Weaken]] and [[Colossus Slayer]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]].

