==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Full-Bloom Kenshin''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Spring Breeze Kenshin''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
She is good at keeping Angel enemies away and dealing high damage to them. Full-Bloom Kenshin outranges most common Angel Threats, and is able to efficiently crowd-control them as most of them are hyper-aggressive pushers.

Be wary of using her in stages like [[Irresistable Henhouse]] where she can push your frontline into the back line enemy's range. She can be useful in [[No Plan A (Deadly)|No Plan A]] as she can allow your frontline to push into [[Cruel Angel Clionel]]'s blind spot without worrying about the other peons.

==='''True Form'''===
Spring Breeze Kenshin gains [[Immune to Weaken|Weaken Immunity]] and [[Colossus Slayer]]. Weaken Immunity helps greatly for countering [[Winged Pigge]] as well as slightly boosting her generalist attacking usage. Colossus Slayer, on the other hand, can help with [[Archangel Exiel]], [[Great Angel Chibinel]] and possibly [[Baron Seal]] since the latter appears with many Angel peons. However, this True Form is extremely expensive, requiring a Gold Catfruit Seed and 2 Aku Catfruit. So, while it is fairly solid, the investment often isn't worth it at all considering the rarity of Gold Seeds.

==='''Talents'''===
'''Target Traitless''' unlocks an entirely new niche for Kenshin, acting as a more damage-oriented [[Relentless Gladios (Uber Rare Cat)|God-Emperor Gladios]]. She has great stats and high range to deal with a wide variety of Traitless threats, from [[R.Ost]] to [[H. Nah]]. She can reliably tank backliners like [[Master A.]] and [[THE SLOTH]], although she pushes them back. (Additionally, Colossus Slayer means she can instantly kill a 200% magnification [[Mega Baa Baa]] at Lv.40.)

These matchups are further improved by the '''[[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]]''' Talent. [[Kory]], [[Mr. Mer]], [[Youcan]], as well as a variety of event enemies no longer pose even the slightest threat to her. Kenshin can also be used as a generalist anti-Waver, having far higher stats than [[Miyamoku Musashi (Special Cat)|Awakened Musashi]], though that is not too surprising. This talent pairs very well with the prior talent to make her one of the best counters to [[Divine Archangel Strikes/Blessing Lv.1~20|levels 11-20 of the Archangel Exiel gauntlet]], as she can now easily counter [[Mr. Mer]] and [[Bore Jr.]] effectively, as well as Exiel itself.

[[Special Abilities#Resist|Resist Curse]] is not very practical. She is already not a great pick for [[Heavenly Tower]]'s [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 50|Floor 50]], and this Talent doesn't change that. It could see niche viability against [[Cafeteria Cat (Enemy)|Cafeteria Cat]] or in mixed stages with Relics, but simply avoiding getting cursed to begin with is usually a good enough option.

Finally, '''Attack Buff''' and '''HP Buff''' are good options if you already have her Target Traitless and Immune to Waves, but be sure to use [[Catseye]]s before spending precious NP.

